Changes to OCCT (V8_0_1) for the Open CAD Viewer. Applied by wasm/scripts/build-occt.sh.

- STEP: a geometric tolerance modifier OCCT has no enumerator for (the ISO 1101 association
  and parameter modifiers of PMI RP Table 14, e.g. UNITED_FEATURE, ASSOCIATED_LEAST_SQUARE_FEATURE)
  is dropped. The six RWStepDimTol readers of modifier lists left such a value at their default,
  MAXIMUM_MATERIAL_REQUIREMENT, so it was read as Ⓜ. The failure is still reported on the entity.
  OCCT PR #1611 (IR branch) keeps the same default.

